<%#
# Contract of an organization in one line

«№ 12 от 15.03.2026», «№ 12» or «от 15.03.2026»; a dash when the organization has neither. The date is a calendar
date (no time of day), so it is printed as it is stored.

## Local variables:

- `organization`: the Organization.
%>
<%
  number = organization.contract_number.presence
  date = organization.contract_date && super_admin_calendar_date(organization.contract_date)
  text = if number && date
           t('super_admin.organizations.contract.both', number: number, date: date)
         elsif number
           t('super_admin.organizations.contract.number', number: number)
         elsif date
           t('super_admin.organizations.contract.date', date: date)
         end
%>
<%= text || '—' %>
